  "family": "fiction",
  "category": "miniature adventure",
  "premise": "A miniature courier must climb to a desk shelf after the ladder is removed. A curled pencil shaving keeps springing open underfoot, so the courier winds it around a thick marker to make a spiral path, delivers the parcel, and leaves the new path for the next traveler.",
